# Xcode
build/
.build/
DerivedData/
.xcode-derived/
*.xcuserdata
# Xcode workspace: keep the shared parts, drop the per-user state.
#
# Not `*.xcworkspace` with negations underneath — git never descends into an excluded
# directory, so `!*.xcworkspace/contents.xcworkspacedata` never did anything and neither
# would a rule for the SPM pin file. That pin has to be tracked: without it a fresh clone
# resolves Sparkle to whatever `from: 2.9.6` allows, and the dependency that ships inside
# the notarized bundle and verifies update signatures would not be the one this was tested
# against.
*.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
*.xcworkspace/xcshareddata/IDEWorkspaceChecks.plist
xcuserdata/

